# API Contract: File Processing Operations

## Purpose
Define the API contract for file processing operations (PDF to image conversion, markdown to PDF conversion)

## Version
1.0.0

## Base URL
`tauri://api` (for Tauri-bound operations)

## Endpoints

### POST /file/process/pdf-to-image
**Description**: Convert PDF document to images with fix for large file processing
**Request Body**:
```json
{
  "inputPath": "string",
  "outputDir": "string",
  "options": {
    "pageRange": {
      "start": "number",
      "end": "number"
    },
    "imageFormat": "png | jpeg",
    "quality": "number (1-100)",
    "resolution": "number (DPI)"
  }
}
```

**Response**:
```json
{
  "jobId": "string",
  "status": "completed | processing | failed",
  "outputFiles": "Array<string>",
  "progress": "number",
  "error": "string | null"
}
```

### POST /file/process/markdown-to-pdf
**Description**: Convert Markdown document to PDF
**Request Body**:
```json
{
  "markdownContent": "string",
  "outputPath": "string",
  "options": {
    "format": "A3 | A4 | A5 | A6 | B3 | B4 | B5 | B6 | Letter | Legal | Tabloid",
    "orientation": "portrait | landscape",
    "margins": {
      "top": "number",
      "bottom": "number", 
      "left": "number",
      "right": "number"
    },
    "header": "string",
    "footer": "string"
  }
}
```

**Response**:
```json
{
  "jobId": "string",
  "status": "completed | processing | failed",
  "outputPath": "string",
  "progress": "number",
  "error": "string | null"
}
```

### GET /file/job/{jobId}
**Description**: Get status of a file processing job
**Response**:
```json
{
  "jobId": "string",
  "taskType": "string",
  "status": "string",
  "progress": "number",
  "outputPath": "string",
  "error": "string | null"
}
```

## Error Responses
All endpoints follow the standard error format:
```json
{
  "error": {
    "code": "string",
    "message": "string",
    "details": "object"
  }
}
```

## Security
- All file system operations require proper Tauri permission configuration
- Input file validation required to prevent malicious files
- Output directory validation to prevent directory traversal
- Memory usage monitoring to prevent DoS from large files